                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR REGISTRIERUNG EINER DRAHTLOSEN VORRICHTUNG IN EINEM DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL D'ENREGISTREMENT DE DISPOSITIF SANS FIL DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR REGISTERING WIRELESS DEVICE IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for establishing a connection for a first electronic device (100) by a second electronic device (110) and a second electronic device (110) is provided. The method includes identifying connection information of the first electronic device (100) obtained by scanning (200) a quick response, QR, code of the first electronic device (100), the connection information including identification information to be used by the second electronic device (110) to identify the first electronic device (100) for a connection operation, performing (210)(306) the connection operation to establish a connection with the first electronic device (100) based on the identified connection information and transmitting (214)(312) to the first electronic device (100) access information of an access point, AP, (120) which is used for the first electronic device (100) to connect to the AP (120), over the established connection.</p>
            </abstract>
